{"id":"2735feec3db7f175","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-knuth-bendix-correctness.md","title":"Knuth-Bendix","display":"Knuth-Bendix","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","display":"Knuth-Bendix","label":"56-thm-knuth-bendix-correctness","aliases":["56-thm-knuth-bendix-correctness"],"type":"theorem","depends_on":["[[56-df-completion-run]]","[[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion]]","[[56-df-convergent]]","[[56-df-equational-theory]]","[[56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order]]","[[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]","[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]"],"source_section":"7.4.2; 7.5.8–7.5.12","source_pages":"279–280; 286–288","source_ocr_blocks":[300,301,307,308,309],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"display","html":"Knuth-Bendix"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-knuth-bendix-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-knuth-bendix-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"21ce7cb11eb92c41\" href=\"?note=21ce7cb11eb92c41\" title=\"56-df-completion-run\">56-df-completion-run</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"00208e314088402a\" href=\"?note=00208e314088402a\" title=\"56-df-knuth-bendix-completion\">56-df-knuth-bendix-completion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eb3dc4a04164786f\" href=\"?note=eb3dc4a04164786f\" title=\"56-df-convergent\">56-df-convergent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59b9207cce58252c\" href=\"?note=59b9207cce58252c\" title=\"56-df-equational-theory\">56-df-equational-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"895d3a7bab17e118\" href=\"?note=895d3a7bab17e118\" title=\"56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order\">56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dcc1e9c43059f569\" href=\"?note=dcc1e9c43059f569\" title=\"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma\">56-thm-critical-pair-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" href=\"?note=edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" title=\"56-thm-newman-lemma\">56-thm-newman-lemma</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.4.2; 7.5.8–7.5.12"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"279–280; 286–288"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>300</span><span>301</span><span>307</span><span>308</span><span>309</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;)\">\\(\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>；输入等式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_0\\subseteq T^2\">\\(E_0\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> 有限。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KBSuccess}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E_0,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KBSuccess}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E_0,R)\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"21ce7cb11eb92c41\" href=\"?note=21ce7cb11eb92c41\" title=\"56-df-completion-run\">56-df-completion-run</a> 的完整有限成功条件及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"00208e314088402a\" href=\"?note=00208e314088402a\" title=\"56-df-knuth-bendix-completion\">56-df-knuth-bendix-completion</a> 的 Table 7.7 转移。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_R^{\\Sigma,V}\">\\(\\equiv_R^{\\Sigma,V}\\)</span> 将有序规则对视为等式对后取等式闭包。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Convergent}(T,\\to_R)\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(s\\equiv_{E_0}^{\\Sigma,V}t\\iff s\\equiv_R^{\\Sigma,V}t\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Convergent}(T,\\to_R)\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(s\\equiv_{E_0}^{\\Sigma,V}t\\iff s\\equiv_R^{\\Sigma,V}t\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 7.4.2。已读 pp.279–280 的证明：运行保持等式闭包，并保持每个临界对已有共同正规化结果或仍有未决等式义务；成功端 E=∅ 给出所有临界对可合流，临界对引理给出局部合流。与固定 reduction order 兼容给出终止，Newman 引理再给出合流。此结论有成功条件，不能从“某 R 曾由补全过程产生”推出。对允许搁置义务的一般抽象运行，须使用 §7.5.8–7.5.12 的公平条件，本定理不覆盖那种未约束的运行。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；7.4.2; 7.5.8–7.5.12，印刷页 279–280; 286–288。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-completion-run","status":"resolved","id":"21ce7cb11eb92c41","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-completion-run]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-knuth-bendix-completion","status":"resolved","id":"00208e314088402a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-convergent","status":"resolved","id":"eb3dc4a04164786f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-convergent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-equational-theory","status":"resolved","id":"59b9207cce58252c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-equational-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"895d3a7bab17e118","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"dcc1e9c43059f569","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-newman-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-completion-run","status":"resolved","id":"21ce7cb11eb92c41","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(>)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$；输入等式集 $E_0\\subseteq T^2$ 有限。假设 $\\mathrm{KBSuccess}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(E_0,R)$，采用 [[56-df-completion-run]] 的完整有限成功条件及 [[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion]] 的 Table 7.7 转移。$\\equiv_R^{\\Sigma,V}$ 将有序规则对视为等式对后取等式闭包。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-knuth-bendix-completion","status":"resolved","id":"00208e314088402a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(>)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$；输入等式集 $E_0\\subseteq T^2$ 有限。假设 $\\mathrm{KBSuccess}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(E_0,R)$，采用 [[56-df-completion-run]] 的完整有限成功条件及 [[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion]] 的 Table 7.7 转移。$\\equiv_R^{\\Sigma,V}$ 将有序规则对视为等式对后取等式闭包。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(>)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"E_0\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KBSuccess}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(E_0,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_R^{\\Sigma,V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Convergent}(T,\\to_R)\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(s\\equiv_{E_0}^{\\Sigma,V}t\\iff s\\equiv_R^{\\Sigma,V}t\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2003,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-244","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-knuth-bendix-correctness.md]]"},{"id":"e6a39a4f73051784","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本节点表述Knuth–Bendix临界对合流判据，文件名与该数学内容一致；有限成功补全过程的正确性由 [[56-thm-knuth-bendix-correctness]] 单独陈述。原书陈述已核对，推导已复核：临界对引理给局部合流，SN配合Newman给合流；反向由合流直接推出。删除了无条件“KB总能成功输出完备系统”的错误断言；原书§2.7.3 p57、§7.4 p279明确允许无限运行或定向失败。"}],"outgoing":["21ce7cb11eb92c41","00208e314088402a","eb3dc4a04164786f","59b9207cce58252c","895d3a7bab17e118","dcc1e9c43059f569","edc2d7f4ffe88f2e"]}